idget": {"name": "model_version"}, "shape": 7, "name": "model_version", "label": "model_version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_version"}, {"widget": {"name": "video"}, "shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "tile"}, "shape": 7, "name": "tile", "label": "tile", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "tile"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 9, "type": "Comfly_Mj", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text_en": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Comfly_Mj", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 26}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n☜☜☜☜   在这选择MJ运行模式，默认使用Relax。\n\n\n\n☜☜☜☜   在这填写MJ的API Key。\n\n☜☜☜☜   在这选择出图比例。\n\n☜☜☜☜   在这选择MJ版本。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [283.20001220703125, 203.6999969482422], "pos": [800, 400], "id": 53, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n☜☜☜☜   在这填写需要手动输入的提示词，或 \n☜☜☜☜   者将反推提示词复制粘贴到这里进行 \n☜☜☜☜   补充修改。   \n☜☜☜☜   无需填写图片比例及使用版本指令。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [239.60000610351562, 119.19999694824219], "pos": [800, 100], "id": 52, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["参数\t作用\t范围\t用法范例\n\n基础参数：基本属性，适合新手使用\n\n–ar\t调整图像长宽比\t任意比例\t/imagine a dog –ar 16:9\n–v / –version\t选择 MJ 模型版本\t1 到 7\t/imagine a dragon –v 7\n–q\t提升品质与生成速度\t0.25 到 2\t/imagine a forest –q 2\n–stop\t控制图像生成完成度：快速预览或生成模煳效果\t10 到 100\t/imagine a forest –stop 50\n–repeat / –r\t重複生成指定次数：生成多组图像以选择最佳\t1 到 100\t/imagine a dog –repeat 5\n–fast\t强制使用快速模式：可快速测试构图\t无需数值\t/imagine a landscape –fast\n–relax\t使用慢速生成：GPU 时间不足时免费生成\t无需数值\t/imagine a forest –relax\n\n风格与创意参数\n\n–stylize / –s\t调整风格化程度：控制艺术性与写实平衡\t0 到 1000\t/imagine a cat –stylize 500\n–p\t在网页版中，进入「Personalization」页面，选择至少 200 张图像后，Midjourney 会生成一个个人化编码\t/imagine a cat –p ekrofdu\n–exp\t启用实验性功能，增强细节\t0 到 100\t/imagine a city –exp 50\n–weird\t控制图像生成的「怪诞程度」\t0 到 3000\t/imagine a city –weird 100\n–chaos / –c\t控制生成随机性\t0 到 100\t/imagine a cat –chaos 50\n–niji\t启用动漫风格模型\t无需数值或 1-6\t/imagine an anime girl –niji 6\n–style\t选择风格变体：细化插画风格，可搭配 Niji\t例如 6a、6b\t/imagine an anime –style 6b\n(a：柔和动漫风；b：鲜明动漫风)\n–test\t启用测试模式 (实验性算法)：测试新算法效果\t无需数值\t/imagine a portrait –test\n–testp\t启用摄影风格测试模式：生成写实摄影风格图像\t无需数值\t/imagine a portrait –testp\n\n参考图像参数\n\n–sref\t指定风格参考图像\t图像 URL 或编码\t/imagine a dog –sref 3666203151\n–sw\t控制风格参考（–sref）影响程度\t0 到 1000\t/imagine a dog –sref 3666203151 –sw 500\n–cref\t指定角色参考图像\t图像 URL\t/imagine a wizard –cref elf.png\n–cw\t控制角色参考（–cref）影响程度\t0 到 100\t/imagine a wizard –cref elf.png –cw 75\n–oref\t指定全能参考图像：将特定元素融入新场景（角色、物体等）\t图像 URL\t/imagine a knight –oref sword.png\n–ow\t控制（–oref） 影响程度\t0 到 1000\t/imagine a knight –oref sword.png –ow 400\n–iw\t控制图像提示影响程度：调整图像与文字提示平衡\t0 到 2\t/imagine a city –iw 1.5\n\n其他进阶参数：适合专业用户或特定需求\n\n–no\t移除特定元素\t任意描述\t/imagine a landscape –no people\n–tile\t生成可平铺图像：设计纹理或壁纸\t无需数值\t/imagine a pattern –tile\n–seed\t指定种子值：重现特定图像风格\t0 到 4294967295\t/imagine a cat –seed 12345\n–video\t生成动画，展示生成过程\t无需数值\t/imagine a sunset –video\n–same\t保持一致性（实验性）\t无需数值\t/imagine a cat –same\n–hd\t提升解析度（V7 中不建议）\t无需数值\t/imagine a city –hd\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [724.2999877929688, 743.4000244140625], "pos": [50, 1150], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n☜☜☜☜   左边四张图片选其中一张，粘贴到右边“加载图像”   ☞☞☞☞\n☜☜☜☜   节点，即可单独用PMRF工作组进行放大处理。         ☞☞☞☞"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [354.3999938964844, 88], "pos": [1200, 900], "id": 55, "properties": {"widget_